@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:verification] complete-bounded-exploration
Verification MUST fail unless the pinned TLC checker completes the declared finite model without
invariant violations and every exported concrete state has a same-invoice recovery path to ready
or committed. Editor replacement and invalidation MUST NOT count as recovery edges.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:verification] graph-derived-evidence
Published graph nodes MUST derive from the completed TLC graph. A projected node MAY be marked
recoverable only when every represented concrete state has passed the recovery check. Mutant
runs MUST fail for stale publication, premature review, stock writes from checking, and lost saved facts.
